@host = https://localhost:7259
@token = PASTE_YOUR_REAL_TOKEN

GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{host}}/spec
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{host}}/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "diff": "--- a/app.js\n+++ b/app.js\n@@ -1,0 +1,3 @@\n+eval(x);\n+console.log(y);\n+// TODO: fix\n" }

###

GET {{host}}/v1/reviews/jobId
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 1a. Idempotency: first call with key k1
POST {{host}}/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: k1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "diff": "--- a/a.js\n+++ b/a.js\n@@ -1,0 +1,1 @@\n+eval(x);\n" }

### 1b. Same key + SAME body -> must return the SAME jobId as 1a
POST {{host}}/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: k1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "diff": "--- a/a.js\n+++ b/a.js\n@@ -1,0 +1,1 @@\n+eval(x);\n" }

### 1c. Same key + DIFFERENT body -> must be 409 idempotency_conflict
POST {{host}}/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: k1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "diff": "--- a/a.js\n+++ b/a.js\n@@ -1,0 +1,1 @@\n+console.log(x);\n" }

### 2a. Caching: submit a body with NO key
POST {{host}}/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "diff": "--- a/c.js\n+++ b/c.js\n@@ -1,0 +1,1 @@\n+eval(y);\n" }

### 2b. Submit the IDENTICAL body again -> GET this job should show cacheHit:true
POST {{host}}/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "diff": "--- a/c.js\n+++ b/c.js\n@@ -1,0 +1,1 @@\n+eval(y);\n" }

### 2c. GET the job from 2b (paste its jobId) -> expect usage.cacheHit = true
GET {{host}}/v1/reviews/PASTE_JOBID_FROM_2b
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. SSE replay: stream a finished job (paste any done jobId)
GET {{host}}/v1/reviews/PASTE_DONE_JOBID/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4a. llm graceful failure: submit with provider llm (no LLM configured)
POST {{host}}/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "diff": "--- a/d.js\n+++ b/d.js\n@@ -1,0 +1,1 @@\n+eval(z);\n", "options": { "provider": "llm" } }

### 4b. GET the job from 4a -> expect status "failed" with a clear error
GET {{host}}/v1/reviews/PASTE_JOBID_FROM_4a
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}